@startuml
title BrewLite — Triển khai AWS Lightsail
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Người dùng" as Customer
artifact "Trình duyệt" as Browser
cloud "VNPay Sandbox" as Gateway
node "Local\nCompose web/API/PostgreSQL" as Local
node "CI — GitHub Actions\nQuality + Browser E2E" as CI
artifact "GHCR\nWeb/API image gắn commit SHA" as Registry

node "AWS Lightsail — ap-southeast-2\nUbuntu 24.04 LTS" as Host {
  artifact "Images web/API\nrelease.compose.yaml theo SHA" as Images
  artifact "Cấu hình máy chủ\nEnv và secret runtime" as Env
  node "Docker Compose — brewlite-server" as Compose {
    component "caddy\nHTTP :80 và HTTPS :443" as Caddy
    component "web\nNext.js standalone\nweb:3000" as Web
    component "api\nNestJS + Prisma\napi:3001" as API
    database "postgres\nPostgreSQL 16\npostgres:5432" as DB
    storage "postgres_data" as Data
    storage "caddy_data và caddy_config" as CaddyData
  }
}

Customer --> Browser
Browser --> Caddy : HTTPS brewlite.vkhair.dev
Browser ..> Gateway : Checkout redirect
Gateway --> Caddy : IPN qua HTTPS
Gateway ..> Browser : Trở về Return URL
Caddy --> Web : Trang web và /api/backend/*
Caddy --> API : /payments/vnpay/return\nvà /payments/vnpay/ipn
Web --> API : Rewrite /api/backend/*
API --> DB : postgres:5432
DB -- Data
Caddy -- CaddyData
Env ..> API : Biến môi trường
Images ..> Compose : Triển khai hai image theo SHA
Local ..> CI : PR, push main hoặc tag v*
CI --> Registry : Build và push image sau hai check
CI --> Host : Tag v* triển khai qua SSH
CI --> Caddy : HTTPS /api/backend/health sau deploy
Registry --> Images : VM pull web/API theo SHA

note bottom of Compose
  Web, API và DB dùng mạng nội bộ Compose.
  API chạy migration và seed trước khi start.
  Healthcheck: PostgreSQL → API → web.
  Log vận hành: docker compose logs.
end note
@enduml
